OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with a frost developing in
OL,7,Fplaces through the evening. Cloud
OL,8,Fbuilds in late in the evening with
OL,9,Fpersistent, locally heavy, rain
OL,10,Fdeveloping and reaching all parts
OL,11,Fafter midnight. Becoming breezy and
OL,12,Ffeeling cold.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FCloudy and wet during the
OL,15,Fmorning with occasionally heavy bouts
OL,16,Fof rain. Drier and brighter periods by
OL,17,Fthe afternoon, but it will be breezy
OL,18,Fand feel fairly chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
