OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FChangeable on Wednesday and Thursday
OL,7,Fwith isolated heavy showers and bright
OL,8,For sunny intervals. Showers clearing
OL,9,Fon Friday. Temperatures near normal
OL,10,Ffor the time of year.
